OL,10,     Fcomplex surgery could cause a
OL,11,     Fbleed or stroke, which could be
OL,12,     Ffatal.
OL,13,G2335 The Hospital: Life on the Line
OL,14,     FRobert is airlifted to the
OL,15,     Fhospital and specialists must
OL,16,     Fquickly release a blockage in his
OL,17,     Fnarrowed artery. Teenager Katie
OL,18,     Fsuffers life-threatening issues
OL,19,     Fpost-heart transplant. (Ep4/4)
